{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33949","headline":"卧病感春寄鲁望 · 皮日休","name":"卧病感春寄鲁望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌皮几上困腾腾，玉柄清羸媿不能。\n昨夜眠时稀似鹤，今朝餐数减於僧。\n药销美禄应夭折，医过芳辰定鬼憎。\n任是雨多游未得，也须收在探花朋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}